abstract: "Lean 4 formalization of the core Arakelov-positivity formalization on the modular curve X₀(143), including the self-intersection value ω² = 48/13 used by the Opera Numerorum Riemann Hypothesis route. This repository is part of David Fox's Opera Numerorum ensemble."
